  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.0: Select() Projection Support - Added Select<TResult>(lambda) for projecting query results to DTOs and anonymous types. Select specific columns to reduce data transfer and improve performance. Includes SelectExpressionVisitor, IProjectionQueryBuilder<T>, and ProjectionQueryBuilder<T>. Fully integrated with Where/OrderBy/Take/Skip. 8 new unit tests (103 total). All features maintain backward compatibility.",
